Subject: IR4 Graph Trace Expected Ledger
Date: 2026-05-26

& [ExpectedGraphTraceLedger: IR4RuntimeGraph] is the expected trace ledger for IR4 runtime graph fixture cases
  + [trace_schema_version] is ir4-runtime-graph-trace-v1
  + [expected_trace_status] is generated_projection_only
  + [expected_non_authority_warning] is present
  + [required_trace_field] is trace_id
  + [required_trace_field] is trace_uuid
  + [required_trace_field] is run_id
  + [required_trace_field] is fixture_id
  + [required_trace_field] is slice_id
  + [required_trace_field] is graph_phase_sequence
  + [required_trace_field] is node_visit_set
  + [required_trace_field] is terminal_outcome
  + [required_trace_field] is source_ref_set
  + [required_trace_field] is operator_trace_ref_set
  + [required_trace_field] is proof_result_ref_set
  + [required_trace_field] is non_authority_warning

& [ExpectedTerminalOutcomeSet: IR4RuntimeGraph] is the expected terminal outcome ledger
  + [fixture_id] is valid_graph_pass
    + [expected_terminal_outcome] is terminal_success
    + [expected_graph_phase_sequence] is packet_intake, readiness_guard, coordination_guard, operator_contract_select, operator_invocation, trace_recording, completion_gate, terminal_outcome
